,["cliffhanger","gancho de suspense"],["supporting cast","elenco de apoio"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A review","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Review: “The Reporter” (TV series) ★★★★☆","paras":["In this series, a young reporter **decides to investigate** a corrupt mayor. She **hopes to find** the truth and **refuses to give up**. Her boss **tells her not to take** risks, but she **manages to reveal** the story.","I **recommend** it. The plot **seems to move** slowly at first, but it **starts to grip** you."],"kicker":"TV REVIEW","by":"Screen Club","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The reporter decides to investigate a mayor.","ans":"T","why":"investigate a corrupt mayor."},{"q":"The reporter gives up.","ans":"F","why":"refuses to give up."},{"q":"The plot starts slowly.","ans":"T","why":"move slowly at first."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“investigate” = ?","opts":["investigar","investir","inventar"],"ans":0,"why":"investigate."},{"q":"“grip” = ?","opts":["prender a atenção","gripe","grupo"],"ans":0,"why":"grip."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Verbo + infinitivo: revisão","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verbo","Exemplo"],"rows":[["decide / hope / refuse","**decides to investigate / refuses to give up**"],["manage","**manages to reveal**"],["seem / start","**seems to move / starts to grip**"],["tell + obj + not to","**tells her not to take risks**"]],"cap":"Verbo + infinitivo: revisão"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"*seem to*, *start to*, *begin to* também pedem **to + base**. *Manage to* = conseguir."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"She decides ___ investigate. (to)","a":"to","why":"decide to."},{"s":"She refuses ___ give up. (to)","a":"to","why":"refuse to."},{"s":"She ___ to reveal the story. (manage, 3ª)","a":"manages",